{"strongs": "H6864", "word": "צֹר", "translit": "tsor", "root": "צרר", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "knives of flint.", "definition": "II. צֹר noun [masculine] id.; — ׳ צ used as knife Exod 4:25 in compare, ׳ כְּשָׁמִיר חָזָק מִצ Ezek 3:9 plural חַרְכוֺת צֻרִים Josh 5:2 ; Josh 5:3 knives of flint. — צזּר חַרְכּוֺ Ps 89:44 is dubious, ׳ צ usually taken as = צֹר , and then either flint of his sword (i.e. sword sharp as flint, Bae ), or edge (like flint) of his sword (most); We leaves untranslated; חֶלְקַת הַצֻּדִים 2Sam 2:16 see I. חֶלְקָה — Job 22:24 see I. צוּר below V. צור . I. צֹר .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7267')\">BDB7267</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6864')\">H6864</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7266')\">BDB7266</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7268')\">BDB7268</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>צֹר</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> id.; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> used as knife <ref ref=\"Exod 4:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,4,25)\">Exod 4:25</ref> in compare, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כְּשָׁמִיר חָזָק מִצ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 3:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,3,9)\">Ezek 3:9</ref> plural <bdbheb>חַרְכוֺת צֻרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 5:2\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(6,5,2)\">Josh 5:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 5:3\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(6,5,3)\">Josh 5:3</ref> <highlight>knives of flint.</highlight> — <bdbheb>צזּר חַרְכּוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 89:44\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,44)\">Ps 89:44</ref> is dubious, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> usually taken as = <bdbheb>צֹר</bdbheb>, and then either <highlight>flint of his sword</highlight> (i.e. sword sharp as flint, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bae')\">Bae</lookup>), or <highlight>edge</highlight> (like flint) <highlight>of his sword</highlight> (most); <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> leaves untranslated; <bdbheb>חֶלְקַת הַצֻּדִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 2:16\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(10,2,16)\">2Sam 2:16</ref> see I.  <bdbheb><reflink>חֶלְקָה</reflink></bdbheb> — <ref ref=\"Job 22:24\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(18,22,24)\">Job 22:24</ref> see I.  <bdbheb><reflink>צוּר</reflink></bdbheb> below V. <bdbheb>צור</bdbheb>. I. <bdbheb>צֹר</bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Exod 4:25", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 4, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Ezek 3:9", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 3, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Josh 5:2", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 5, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Josh 5:3", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 5, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Ps 89:44", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 89, "verse": 44}, {"raw": "2Sam 2:16", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 2, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Job 22:24", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 22, "verse": 24}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["צֹר", "׳", "צ", "כְּשָׁמִיר חָזָק מִצ", "חַרְכוֺת צֻרִים", "צזּר חַרְכּוֺ", "חֶלְקַת הַצֻּדִים", "חֶלְקָה", "צוּר", "צור"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Bae", "We"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB7267", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}